<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:12.0pt"><span style="display: none;">&nbsp;</span><span style="display: none;">&nbsp;</span><span style="font-size:12px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">Good Morning/Afternoon,</span></span></p>

<p><span style="font-size:12px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">We understand how difficult it is to say goodbye to a loved one, and we truly appreciate the challenges this time poses for the family.</span></span></p>

<p><span style="font-size:12px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">Given the added stress of being away from home, we are here to support you in arranging this sensitive trip. You can rest assured that we will handle the transportation of your loved one with the utmost dignity and priority throughout the journey.</span></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:12.0pt"><span style="font-size:12px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">With reference to a booking for The late……………………….., we would like to confirm the following details…</span> </span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:12.0pt"><span style="font-size:12px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">AWB no.<br />
Flight:<br />
Collection:</span></span><span style="font-size:11px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></span><span style="font-size:12px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">Once checked, you can track the shipment on our website, Qantas Freight, or call 13 12 13.</span></span><br />
<br />
<span style="font-size:12px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">Collection is available approx. 90mins after the flight arrival (Subject to customs clearance status) at: </span></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:12.0pt"><span style="font-size:12px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">Qantas International Freight Terminal </span></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:12.0pt"><span style="color:#c0392b;"><span style="font-size:12px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">&lt; copy and paste from QF website&gt;</span></span></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:12.0pt"><span style="font-size:12px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">&nbsp; </span></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:12.0pt">&nbsp;</p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:12.0pt"><span style="font-size:12px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">&nbsp; </span></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:12.0pt"><span style="font-size:12px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">Photo identification is required and there is an import service charge of approx. $170.00 to pay on collection. We recommend reaching out to Australian Customs to confirm if there are any charges and/ or clearance required - Please phone 1300 558 099 for further assistance.</span></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:12px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">After lodgement, you will be able to track the progress of your shipment at <a href="http://www.qantasfreight.com.au/">www.qantasfreight.com.au</a> </span></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal">&nbsp;</p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:12.0pt"><span style="font-size:11px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:
normal"><u style="text-underline:thick">In order for us to proceed with the booking please confirm acceptance by return email.</u></b><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:
normal"><u style="text-underline:thick"> </u></b></span></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal">&nbsp;</p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:11px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></span><span style="font-size:11px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">&nbsp; </span></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:11px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span lang="EN-US">Regards, </span><span lang="EN-US"> </span></span></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal">&nbsp;</p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:11px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><b><span lang="EN-US">S</span></b></span></span><b style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11px;">pecial Movements</b></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:11px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span lang="EN-US">Qantas Freight, Customer Service</span><span lang="EN-US"> </span></span></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:11px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span lang="EN-US">Qantas Airways Limited </span></span></span><br />
<br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Aptos,sans-serif"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:10.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">QCB6, 10 Bourke Road&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span><br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Aptos,sans-serif"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:10.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">Mascot NSW 2020</span></span></span></span></span><br />
<span style="font-size:11px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span lang="EN-US">P.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 13 12 13</span><span lang="EN-US"> </span></span></span></p>

